Rusty Rex is a remake of the T-Rex runner, the game Chrome shows when it has
no internet connection.

    Chromium's dino game
    https://github.com/chromium/chromium/tree/main/components/neterror/resources/dino_game
    BSD 3-Clause License, Copyright The Chromium Authors

The game is that project's design: the rex, the cacti and pterodactyls, the
day and night cycle and the moon's phases, and the speeds, timings and scoring
this program follows. Rusty Rex reimplements it in Rust and includes none of
Chromium's source code.
